  "text": "Skip to main content\nBook Now\nA beauty salon in Brackley for nails, brows, and skin\n\nBuilder gel nails, HD Brows, lamination, and Dermalogica facials. One-to-one with Meghan in Brackley. All prices include consultation, prep, finish, and aftercare notes.\n\nNails\nBrows\nSkin\nPackages\nNails\n\nFrom \u00a330. Builder gel, gel polish, pedicures, and nail art.\n\nGel Toe Finish\n30 min\n\u00b7\n\u00a330\n\nA quick gel colour refresh for toes. No full pedicure, just a clean, lasting finish.\n\nGel Manicure\n60 min\n\u00b7\n\u00a332\n\nGlossy, long-lasting colour with a beautifully polished finish\n\nBuilder Gel Manicure\nMOST POPULAR\n70 min\n\u00b7\n\u00a345\n\nStronger, chip-free nails that hold gel colour for three to four weeks.\n\nElim Pedicure\n60 min\n\u00b7\n\u00a355\n\nHard skin cleared at the source, so it is slower to come back\n\nBrows\n\nFrom \u00a312. HD Brows, lamination, and shape.\n\nEyebrow Wax\n10 min\n\u00b7\n\u00a312\n\nA fast, targeted wax to tidy the brow line and hold your shape between full appointments.\n\nUpper Lip Wax\n10 min\n\u00b7\n\u00a312\n\nQuick and effective removal of fine hair around the upper lip using gentle wax. Leaves the skin smooth, clean and makeup-ready.\n\nHD Brows\u2122 Express\n20 min\n\u00b7\n\u00a323\n\nSharp, defined brows with a clean refresh between full appointments\n\nHD Brows\u2122\n40 min\n\u00b7\n\u00a328\n\nFuller, defined brows with a soft, natural finish tailored to your face\n\nPatch test required\n\nBrow Lamination\n60 min\n\u00b7\n\u00a338\n\nLifted, fuller brows styled for 4-6 weeks\n\nPatch test required\n\nSkin\n\nFrom \u00a350. Facials assessed on the day.\n\nEssential Skin Method\n60 min\n\u00b7\n\u00a350\n\nSkin consulted, cleansed and rebalanced, whatever it needs that day\n\nRenew Skin Method\n60 min\n\u00b7\n\u00a360\n\nSmoother texture, brighter tone, and makeup that sits properly again\n\nClear Skin Method\n75 min\n\u00b7\n\u00a375\n\nSkin that feels genuinely clean, calmer and clearer\n\nSIGNATURE PACKAGES\n\nMulti-treatment bundles\n\nCurated combinations for regulars, brides, and anyone who wants nails, brows, or skin done in one sitting.\n\nPatch test required\nMonthly Maintenance: Nails & Brows\n\n\u00a358\n\n90 min\n\nBuilder Gel infilled and brows shaped, waxed and tinted in one appointment\n\nBook now\nBuilder Gel Bundle\n\n\u00a365\n\n120 min\n\nHands and toes in one sitting, a full Builder Gel set with matching gel toes.\n\nBook now\nSkin & Nail Maintenance\n\nFor existing clients\n\n\u00a370\n\n105 min\n\nNails and skin both maintained in a single appointment\n\nA Builder Gel rebalance paired with an Essential Skin Method, nails refreshed, skin reset, in one sitting.\n\nBook now\nPatch test required\nSignature Holiday Glow-Up Package\n\n\u00a3115\n\n165 min\n\nHands, feet and brows all handled in one visit\n\nBook now\nWhat clients say\n\nReal words from real clients in Brackley.\n\n\u201cI can\u2019t fault Meghan\u2019s work! She is so professional, prices are amazing and the nails are fabulous! I\u2019ve been consistently getting my nails done here for almost a year now and I wouldn\u2019t go anywhere else, there\u2019s nothing that she can\u2019t do!\u201d\n\nEmma\n\n\u201cMeghan is amazing at what she does. Not only is she really friendly, welcoming and a lovely person, she is very professional, attentive, and you will leave with incredible nails every time. I have been going to Meghan for six months and I wouldn\u2019t go anywhere else. My nails are much stronger and longer than ever before - and they look great! Her home salon is always well-presented, clean and comfortable. I can\u2019t recommend her enough! \u201d\n\nLauren\n\n\u201cMeghan is a pro at what she does! She\u2019s been doing BIAB for me for the last 6 months and my nails have never been in better condition. She is so lovely to sit and chat to and the selection of colours is huge, you\u2019re spoilt for choice! 10/10 would recommend \u263a\ufe0f\u201d\n\nSamantha\n\nCANCELLATION\n\nA 30% non-refundable deposit is required to secure all bookings. With at least 24 hours' notice we can move your deposit once to a new appointment time. Cancellations or rescheduling with less than 24 hours' notice, or no-shows, will result in your deposit being forfeited. Please see our full cancellation policy for details.\n\nPAYMENT\n\nCard payments, Apple Pay, Cash and online payments when booking.\n\nReady to book?\n\nSquare booking takes under two minutes. Or message me if you want to talk a treatment through first.\n\nBook now\n\nEXPLORE BY CATEGORY\n\nVisit a dedicated page.\n\nNails\n\nBuilder gel that holds three to four weeks. Gel polish, pedicures, and nail art.\n\nBrows\n\nHD Brows, lamination, and shape. Mapped to your bone structure.\n\nSkin\n\nFacials assessed on the day. Bespoke, microdermabrasion, or deep clearing.\n\nPackages\n\nMulti-treatment bundles. Nails, brows, and skin done in one visit, from \u00a358.\n\nBook now\n\nOne appointment at a time, with Meghan.\n\nBook Now\nVISIT\nThursday 12pm \u2013 8pm\nFriday 12pm \u2013 8pm\nSaturday 9am \u2013 4pm\nClosed Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Sunday\n07449137478\nWhatsApp us\nhello@mmm-beauty.co.uk\nTudor Way, Brackley NN13 6NH \u00b7 Free on-street parking\n\nExact door number provided in your booking confirmation.\n\nEXPLORE\nTreatments\nNails\nBrows\nSkin\nJournal\nAreas we serve\nHELP\nGift cards\nAftercare\nAbout & FAQs\nPolicies\nAccessibility\nCookie settings\nSTUDIO UPDATES\n\nOccasional offers and studio news from Meghan. Unsubscribe any time. See our Privacy Policy.\n\nEmail address\nSubscribe\n\u00a9 2026 MMM Beauty, the trading name of Meghan Meehan, a sole trader \u00b7 Brackley, UK\nWebsite by\nDoman Digital\n\nLumi\n\nLumi can help with treatments, aftercare, or booking questions.\n\nResponses are AI-generated. Conversations are kept for 24 hours to stay in context, then deleted automatically.\n\nOnline\n\nI'm Lumi, MMM Beauty's digital assistant. How can I hel